  <note>
    <content textType="body">
      <p>Before any code, the world it lives in. A shopper buys from a merchant; the merchant sends the card details to our gateway; the gateway forwards the request to an acquiring bank and stores the result. The bank in this exercise is a Mountebank simulator in Docker, provided by the challenge - we integrate with it as-is. The key mental model: we do not decide yes or no. The bank does. We are the reliable, honest messenger in the middle.</p>
    </content>
  </note>
